#: ../../library/omv.image.BarCode.rst:40
msgid ""
"4-tuple of ``(x, y)`` integer tuples for the four detected corners of the "
"barcode, sorted clockwise starting from the top-left corner. Index ``[8]``."
msgstr ""
"4-tuple van ``(x, y)`` integer-tuples voor de vier gedetecteerde hoeken van "
"de barcode, met de klok mee gesorteerd vanaf de linkerbovenhoek. Index "
"``[8]``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.image.BarCode.rst:46
msgid ""
"``(x, y, w, h)`` 4-tuple of the bounding box. Suitable for passing directly "
"to drawing/cropping methods such as `Image.draw_rectangle()` or "
"`Image.crop()`. Index ``[9]``."
msgstr ""
"``(x, y, w, h)`` 4-tuple van het begrenzingsvak. Geschikt om rechtstreeks "
"door te geven aan teken-/bijsnijdmethoden zoals `Image.draw_rectangle()` of "
"`Image.crop()`\\ . Index ``[9]``\\ ."

